! Each magnet is half a betatron period long, with no drift between them, so each hands the next
! the beam it received, mirrored.  The aperture file is narrowest at the magnet centers (s = 0.5,
! 1.5, 2.5 and 3.5 m) and wide at their ends.  KQUSE comes first, while y is small: every magnet
! focuses x, so y grows about twelve times in each.
